# Web admin

- React + TypeScript + Vite. No extra UI kits unless already in package.json.
- Live page: employee cards (online/offline, since, last window title, click rate, last thumb).
- Day view: punch timeline + 30-min activity bars + screenshot strip.
- Theme = **black / yellow-gold / white** per `docs/14-ui-theme.md` (client voice 20 Aug).
- Agent: corner **LIVE** red blink while tracking (`docs/21-client-voice-2026-08-20-plan.md`).
- Frontend quality per `docs/15-frontend-quality.md`.
- Reports: daily + monthly; responsive per `docs/19-responsive.md`.
- Sign-out stops PC tracking only; manager keeps history.
